# Build context filter for lab/images/nyx-daemon.Dockerfile (the context is the repo root).
# Docker (BuildKit) uses <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile in preference to a root
# .dockerignore, so this file applies only to the daemon image.
# Allowlist: send only what `cargo build -p nyx-daemon` needs, never target/, node_modules, ui, etc.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!vcpkg.json
!crates
# src-tauri is a workspace member: Cargo must read its manifest (and see its source paths)
# to resolve the workspace, even though it is never built in the image.
!src-tauri/Cargo.toml
!src-tauri/src
**/target
